<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Oct central bank reserves $10.1 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Oct central bank reserves $10.1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's central bank reserves stood at $10.1 billion in October, compared to $10.4 billion in September, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>    HUNGARY RESERVES ($ MILLION)  OCT 96	  SEPT 96</p>
<p>    International reserves	 10,148.9	 10.363.0</p>
<p>	 Of which gold		     40.4	     40.5</p>
<p>    Other foreign assets	    3,945.0	  3,523.3</p>
<p>NOTE - the NBH values gold at London market prices.</p>
</text>
